play=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-[#F6F6F8] text-[#0B0B0D]\"><header class=\"bg-surface h-[56px] w-full sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-rule flex items-center justify-between px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop\"><a class=\"font-body-sm text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink uppercase tracking-widest hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-600\" href=\"/studio\">FASHIONAI.AGENCY</a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-stack-md\"><a class=\"font-utility-label text-utility-label uppercase tracking-widest text-ink font-bold border-b border-ink pb-0.5\" href=\"/studio\">STUDIO</a><span class=\"font-utility-label text-utility-label uppercase tracking-widest text-[#56565F] opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed select-none flex items-center gap-1.5\" title=\"Disponible en Phase 2\">KITS <span class=\"text-[9px] bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 px-1 py-0.2 font-mono\">BIENTÔT</span></span><span class=\"font-utility-label text-utility-label uppercase tracking-widest text-[#56565F] opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed select-none flex items-center gap-1.5\" title=\"Disponible en Phase 2\">SÉANCE <span class=\"text-[9px] bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 px-1 py-0.2 font-mono\">BIENTÔT</span></span><span class=\"font-utility-label text-utility-label uppercase tracking-widest text-[#56565F] opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed select-none flex items-center gap-1.5\" title=\"Disponible en Phase 2\">TRAVAILLER ENSEMBLE <span class=\"text-[9px] bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 px-1 py-0.2 font-mono\">BIENTÔT</span></span></nav></header><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#F6F6F8] text-[#0B0B0D] p-6 md:p-12 font-mono\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-10\"><div class=\"border-b border-[#DCDCE2] pb-6\"><div class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#56565F] mb-1\">Studio fashionai · Console Interne</div><h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#0B0B0D]\">Test Pipeline &amp; Fournisseurs</h1><p class=\"text-sm text-[#56565F] mt-2\">Page de test isolée pour exécuter les agents LLM et les modèles de génération d&#x27;images selon la couche d&#x27;abstraction (PRD A0-11).</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-6 space-y-6\"><div class=\"border-b border-[#DCDCE2] pb-3 flex justify-between items-center\"><h2 class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-[#0B0B0D]\">1. Étage Agent LLM</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase text-[#56565F] mb-1\">Agent</label><select class=\"w-full bg-[#F6F6F8] border border-[#DCDCE2] text-xs p-2.5 text-[#0B0B0D] focus:outline-none\"><option value=\"cloth\" selected=\"\">cloth (Ghost Mannequin)</option><option value=\"swap\">swap (Plan Maître)</option><option value=\"transfert_profil\">transfert_profil (3/4)</option><option value=\"transfert_dos\">transfert_dos (Dos)</option></select></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase text-[#56565F] mb-1\">Fournisseur LLM</label><select class=\"w-full bg-[#F6F6F8] border border-[#DCDCE2] text-xs p-2.5 text-[#0B0B0D] focus:outline-none\"><option value=\"cloudflare\" selected=\"\">Cloudflare Workers AI (Llama 3.3 70B)</option><option value=\"gemini\">Google Gemini (gemini-2.0-flash)</option><option value=\"openai\">OpenAI (GPT-4o)</option></select></div></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase text-[#56565F] mb-1\">Image de référence / Vêtement</label><input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" class=\"w-full text-xs text-[#56565F] file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:border-0 file:text-xs file:bg-[#0B0B0D] file:text-white file:cursor-pointer\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase text-[#56565F] mb-1\">Entrée utilisateur / Précisions (@precisions, @modifs)</label><textarea rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Ex: Robe en lin beige, col V, fermeture zippée invisible dans le dos...\" class=\"w-full bg-[#F6F6F8] border border-[#DCDCE2] text-xs p-2.5 text-[#0B0B0D] focus:outline-none\"></textarea></div><button class=\"w-full py-3 bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-medium hover:bg-neutral-800 disabled:opacity-50 transition-colors\">Exécuter l&#x27;Agent</button></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-6 space-y-6\"><div class=\"border-b border-[#DCDCE2] pb-3 flex justify-between items-center\"><h2 class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-[#0B0B0D]\">2. Étage Génération Image</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase text-[#56565F] mb-1\">Fournisseur Image</label><select class=\"w-full bg-[#F6F6F8] border border-[#DCDCE2] text-xs p-2.5 text-[#0B0B0D] focus:outline-none\"><optgroup label=\"── Google Cloud ──\"><option value=\"vertex\">Google Vertex AI · Imagen 3 (Haute Qualité Studio)</option></optgroup><optgroup label=\"── GRATUIT (Sans clé API) ──\"><option value=\"hf-dev\">🟢 HuggingFace · FLUX.1-dev (Haute qualité, ~8s) — GRATUIT</option><option value=\"hf-schnell\">🟢 HuggingFace · FLUX.1-schnell (Ultra-rapide, ~2s) — GRATUIT</option></optgroup><optgroup label=\"── Autres Payants ──\"><option value=\"fal\" selected=\"\">Fal.ai (Seedream / Flux Pro)</option><option value=\"cloudflare\">Cloudflare Workers AI (Flux 1 Schnell)</option><option value=\"replicate\">Replicate (Flux 1.1 Pro)</option></optgroup></select></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase text-[#56565F] mb-1\">Ratio d&#x27;aspect</label><select class=\"w-full bg-[#F6F6F8] border border-[#DCDCE2] text-xs p-2.5 text-[#0B0B0D] focus:outline-none\"><option value=\"2:3\" selected=\"\">2:3 (Plan Maître)</option><option value=\"1:1\">1:1 (Vues Série)</option><option value=\"16:9\">16:9 (Triptyque / Paysage)</option></select></div></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase text-[#56565F] mb-1\">Prompt Image</label><textarea rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"Entrez le prompt à envoyer au générateur d&#x27;image...\" class=\"w-full bg-[#F6F6F8] border border-[#DCDCE2] text-xs p-2.5 text-[#0B0B0D] focus:outline-none\"></textarea></div><button disabled=\"\" class=\"w-full py-3 bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-medium hover:bg-neutral-800 disabled:opacity-50 transition-colors\">Générer l&#x27;Image</button></div></div></div></div><footer class=\"bg-background text-ink w-full border-t border-rule flex flex-col items-start gap-stack-md px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-stack-lg mt-auto\"><div class=\"w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-stack-md\"><nav class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-stack-sm md:gap-stack-md w-full\"><a class=\"font-utility-label text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-600\" href=\"/studio\">STUDIO</a><span class=\"text-rule hidden md:inline\">|</span><span class=\"font-utility-label text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-soft opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed select-none\">KITS (BIENTÔT)</span><span class=\"text-rule hidden md:inline\">|</span><span class=\"font-utility-label text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-soft opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed select-none\">SÉANCE (BIENTÔT)</span><span class=\"text-rule hidden md:inline\">|</span><span class=\"font-utility-label text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-soft opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed select-none\">TRAVAILLER ENSEMBLE (BIENTÔT)</span></nav></div><div class=\"w-full border-t border-rule pt-stack-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-[#56565F]\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-[#0B0B0D] font-bold\">Réseaux Stephen :</span><a href=\"https://wa.me/2250757512959\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#25D366] font-bold hover:underline\">WhatsApp (+225 0757512959)</a><span>·</span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/stephe